1308
01:09:08,233 --> 01:09:10,025
- Oh, thank you, Janie.
- <b><font color="#ca004b">[CHUCKLES]</font></b>

1309
01:09:12,233 --> 01:09:14,733
As, uh... As some of you may know,

1310
01:09:14,816 --> 01:09:17,566
the most valuable minerals in the world

1311
01:09:17,650 --> 01:09:19,775
