1318
01:09:41,608 --> 01:09:43,650
So you can imagine.
<b><font color="#ca004b">[LAUGHING]</font></b>

1319
01:09:43,733 --> 01:09:44,733
Wow!

1320
01:09:44,775 --> 01:09:48,566
Just how happy we were at BASH

1321
