1425
01:15:18,941 --> 01:15:20,126
- <b><font color="#cf685c">WOMAN:</font></b> Yeah.
- <b><font color="#cf685c">MAN:</font></b> Please.

1426
01:15:20,150 --> 01:15:22,608
- <b><font color="#cf685c">OGLETHORPE:</font></b> Kate, don't. Kate.
