1438
01:16:03,025 --> 01:16:04,983
I'm so sorry, Kate. Really, I am.

1439
01:16:05,066 --> 01:16:07,066
<b><font color="#cf685c">KATE:</font></b> Oh, Randall. God.

1440
01:16:07,900 --> 01:16:09,900
Where's Brie Evantee?

1441
01:16:09,983 --> 01:16:12,400
Shouldn't you two
