1447
01:16:27,066 --> 01:16:28,900
<b><font color="#cf685c">KATE:</font></b> I can't! My head is in a bag!

1448
01:16:28,983 --> 01:16:31,608
<b><font color="#cf685c">AGENT:</font></b> Sorry, Dr. Mindy.
White House wants her off the grid.

1449
01:16:31,691 --> 01:16:33,191
- Come on, now. Look--
- <b><font color="#cf685c">AGENT:</font></b> Now.

1450
01:16:33,275 --> 01:16:35,983
<b><font color="#cf685c">KATE:</font></b> Wait. What does that mean?
What the hell does that mean?

1451
01:16:36,066 --> 01:16:38,441
- What does "off the grid" mean?
- <b><font color="#cf685c">MINDY:</font></b> Hey, Kate.

1452
01:16:39,316 --> 01:16:42,441
Oh, gosh. Kate! Are you okay?

